3. PROFESSIONAL SERVICES

You may use the Software as a tool while You provide services to
others for a fee, such as incident response, digital forensic
investigation, security monitoring, assessments, consulting,
technical support or training, as long as You do not Distribute the
Software for Compensation and do not offer it as a Paid Service. You
may deliver to Your clients the reports and results You produce with
the Software.

4. FREE REDISTRIBUTION

You may Distribute the Software or a Modified Version only if all of
the following are met:

(a) no Compensation is charged for it;
(b) You include the complete source code, or a link from which it can
    be downloaded free of charge for as long as You Distribute the
    copy;
(c) recipients receive it under this same license with no added
    restrictions, and You license Your own changes to them on the
    same terms;
(d) You keep all copyright, license and attribution notices, and You
    show this notice where users will see it:
    "Based on ATAD (عَتاد) by the ATAD Team (Hoor Fawaz, Danah Fawaz)";
(e) for a Modified Version, You include a file named MODIFICATIONS
    stating Your name, the date of each modification and a summary
    of what changed; You mark the changed files; and You give it a
    name that is not "ATAD" or "عَتاد" and is not confusingly
    similar to them;
(f) You do not present any Modified Version as an official ATAD
    release, and You do not claim to be the author or owner of the
    Software.

An unmodified copy of an official release may keep the name ATAD.

